---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: VisibilitySystems::CheckVisibility · 对象关系
  accDescr: 中心对象与所有直接关联对象；完整保留入边、出边及原投影和注册身份，不递归展开间接关系。
  %% n*/e* 是业务节点/关系，sc* 是阶段关系；layout_* 仅用于排版。
  classDef node_system fill:#EFF3F8,stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_system_set fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6A778C,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_engine_flow fill:#F1F5F4,stroke:#557C78,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef edge_order stroke:#334155,stroke-width:2px
  classDef edge_set_membership stroke:#6A778C,stroke-width:1.4px,stroke-dasharray:2 4
  classDef edge_registration stroke:#64748B,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef external_node stroke-dasharray:6 4
  n0@{ shape: lin-rect, label: "**VisibilitySystems::CheckVisibility**<br/>汇总各视图可见对象并更新实体可见标记。" }
  class n0 node_system_set
  n1@{ shape: stadium, label: "**main · PostUpdate**<br/>保存本应用调度的注册上下文与成员。" }
  class n1 node_engine_flow
  n2@{ shape: rounded, label: "**check_visibility_cpu_culling**<br/>按层、距离和视锥收集各相机可见实体。" }
  class n2 node_system
  n3@{ shape: rounded, label: "**check_visibility_gpu_culling**<br/>同步退出 CPU 裁剪对象的层级可见状态。" }
  class n3 node_system
  n4@{ shape: rounded, label: "**check_visibility_ranges**<br/>按视图距离计算实体可见范围位掩码。" }
  class n4 node_system
  n5@{ shape: lin-rect, label: "**VisibilitySystems::**<br/>**VisibilityPropagate**<br/>在项目显隐同步后传播可见性。" }
  class n5 node_system_set
  n6@{ shape: lin-rect, label: "**VisibilitySystems::UpdateFrusta**<br/>根据相机投影与世界变换更新视锥。" }
  class n6 node_system_set
  n7@{ shape: lin-rect, label: "**VisibilitySystems::CalculateBounds**<br/>为可见性检查计算并插入对象包围盒。" }
  class n7 node_system_set
  n8@{ shape: rounded, label: "**check_point_light_mesh_visibility**<br/>计算点光与聚光灯阴影可见的网格。" }
  class n8 node_system
  n9@{ shape: rounded, label: "**assign_objects_to_clusters**<br/>将灯光、探针及贴花分配到视图分簇。" }
  class n9 node_system
  n10@{ shape: rounded, label: "**check_dir_light_mesh_visibility**<br/>计算方向光各相机级联可见的投影网格。" }
  class n10 node_system
  n11@{ shape: rounded, label: "**update_directional_light_frusta**<br/>从方向光级联投影更新阴影视锥。" }
  class n11 node_system
  n1 e0@-->|"main / PostUpdate"| n0
